OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMist and fog patches through
OL,6,Fthe valleys, with brighter conditions
OL,7,Fto start elsewhere. The patches will
OL,8,Fclear through the morning to leave a
OL,9,Fpartly cloudy afternoon with good
OL,10,Fsunny spells. Light winds. Feeling
OL,11,Fpleasant in any sunshine later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA fine evening with good
OL,14,Fclear spells. Further mist and fog
OL,15,Fpatches develop through the night
OL,16,Fthrough low lying prone areas but
OL,17,Fturning clear and cool elsewhere.
OL,18,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
