OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA fine start for most, with
OL,6,Fsome areas of mist and fog. These will
OL,7,Fclear to leave a fine day with good
OL,8,Fsunny spells, then return later. Mild.
OL,9,FLight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fto start with patchy rain, but a fine
OL,13,Fend to Sunday. Fine and dry on Monday
OL,14,Fbefore a cloudier day on Tuesday.
OL,15,FTemperatures around average. Generally
OL,16,Flight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
